><p><b>class</b>: <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-ActCode.html#v3-ActCode-IMP\">ActCode: IMP</a> (inpatient encounter)</p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-example-ihe-france-pam-patient.html\">JEANNE MARIE-CECILE DARK  Female, Date de Naissance :1960-05-30 ( IPP: 1900068)</a></p><p><b>period</b>: 2025-02-03 09:00:00+0100 --&gt; (en cours)</p></div>"
